Package: chorale
Title: Phenotype-Led Factor Matching Across Disjoint Omics Modalities
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Francesco", "Lescai", , "francesco.lescai@unipv.it", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Finds phenotype-led, design-concordant factor groupings across
    molecular modalities measured on disjoint sample sets. Components are
    extracted independently within each modality and matched jointly so the
    resulting correspondences are cycle consistent. Shared covariates refine
    phenotype-compatible alternatives but cannot replace missing phenotype
    evidence. Reports ambiguity, pathway corroboration, negative controls and
    partial-identification bounds instead of selecting an unidentified
    cross-modality coupling.
